  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 8c1a70fcd7e8f8c42920e122a812509f, type: 3}
  m_Name: StoryData 6
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::StoryData
  sprites:
  - {fileID: 5465676260196508250, guid: a77b8ffe2d91fb94aa00878855bf6c0a, type: 3}
  - {fileID: -6590899960607402449, guid: 2f2c03f217873374db23dddd3c2d013c, type: 3}
  - {fileID: -4658881244732153591, guid: 056ef4b4693e28b4facc0e65b538925b, type: 3}
  - {fileID: -3117484068076936332, guid: 4740f451e870def43a94cf94220388b7, type: 3}
  - {fileID: -2045847134202036659, guid: 888263d3613889d4395a117461415ba4, type: 3}
  dialogues:
  - nextImage: 0
    translations:
    - languageType: 0
      speaker: Narrator
      dialogue: Their sturdy platform soon yielded a basket full of silver fish.
        Marin proudly held it up for Mocha.
    - languageType: 1
      speaker: "\uB0B4\uB808\uC774\uC158"
      dialogue: "\uD2BC\uD2BC\uD574\uC9C4 \uC88C\uB300\uC5D0\uC11C \uC740\uBE5B \uBB3C\uACE0\uAE30\uAC00
        \uBC14\uAD6C\uB2C8 \uAC00\uB4DD \uBAA8\uC600\uB2E4. \uB9C8\uB9B0\uC774 \uBAA8\uCE74\uC5D0\uAC8C
        \uC790\uB791\uC2A4\uB7FD\uAC8C \uB4E4\uC5B4 \uBCF4\uC600\uB2E4."
  - nextImage: 0
    translations:
    - languageType: 0
      speaker: Marin
      dialogue: First basket goes to market! I'm coming, too.
    - languageType: 1
      speaker: "\uB9C8\uB9B0"
      dialogue: "\uCCAB \uBC14\uAD6C\uB2C8\uB294 \uC7A5\uD130\uB85C! \uB098\uB3C4
        \uAC19\uC774 \uAC08\uB798."
  - nextImage: 1
    translations:
    - languageType: 0
      speaker: Narrator
      dialogue: Mocha and Marin set down their basket of fish. The merchant looked
        pleased, but kept the key.
    - languageType: 1
      speaker: "\uB0B4\uB808\uC774\uC158"
      dialogue: "\uBAA8\uCE74\uC640 \uB9C8\uB9B0\uC740 \uBB3C\uACE0\uAE30 \uBC14\uAD6C\uB2C8\uB97C
        \uB0B4\uB824\uB193\uC558\uB2E4. \uC554\uC0C1\uC778\uC740 \uD750\uBB47\uD558\uAC8C
        \uBB3C\uAC74\uC744 \uC0B4\uD3C8\uC9C0\uB9CC \uC5F4\uC1E0\uB97C \uB0B4\uC8FC\uC9C0\uB294
        \uC54A\uC558\uB2E4."
  - nextImage: 0
    translations:
    - languageType: 0
      speaker: Merchant
      dialogue: Fresh catch. I look forward to your next delivery.
    - languageType: 1
      speaker: "\uC554\uC0C1\uC778"
      dialogue: "\uC2F1\uC2F1\uD558\uB124. \uB2E4\uC74C \uBB3C\uAC74\uB3C4 \uAE30\uB300\uD560\uAC8C."
  - nextImage: 1
    translations:
    - languageType: 0
      speaker: Narrator
      dialogue: Now there was even a gold coin on top of the key's price. The merchant
        held out a white-flowered herb.
    - languageType: 1
      speaker: "\uB0B4\uB808\uC774\uC158"
      dialogue: "\uC5F4\uC1E0\uAC12 \uC704\uC5D0 \uAE08\uD654\uAE4C\uC9C0 \uC5B9\uD614\uB2E4.
        \uC554\uC0C1\uC778\uC740 \uD770 \uAF43\uC774 \uB2EC\uB9B0 \uC57D\uCD08\uB97C
        \uB0B4\uBC00\uC5C8\uB2E4."
  - nextImage: 0
    translations:
    - languageType: 0
      speaker: Merchant
      dialogue: The soaked porters need some tea. Find me herbs like these.
    - languageType: 1
      speaker: "\uC554\uC0C1\uC778"
      dialogue: "\uBE44 \uB9DE\uC740 \uC9D0\uAFBC\uB4E4\uD55C\uD14C \uCC28\uAC00
        \uD544\uC694\uD574. \uC774\uB7F0 \uC57D\uCD08\uB97C \uAD6C\uD574 \uC640."
  - nextImage: 1
    translations:
    - languageType: 0
      speaker: Narrator
      dialogue: Flora bent over her seedlings to shield them from the rain. Mocha
        knelt beside her and held the cover.
    - languageType: 1
      speaker: "\uB0B4\uB808\uC774\uC158"
      dialogue: "\uD50C\uB85C\uB77C\uB294 \uC5B4\uB9B0 \uC57D\uCD08 \uC704\uB85C
        \uBAB8\uC744 \uC219\uC5EC \uBE44\uB97C \uB9C9\uACE0 \uC788\uC5C8\uB2E4. \uBAA8\uCE74\uAC00
        \uBB34\uB98E\uC744 \uAFC7\uACE0 \uB36E\uAC1C\uB97C \uBD99\uC7A1\uC558\uB2E4."
  - nextImage: 0
    translations:
    - languageType: 0
      speaker: Flora
      dialogue: They're getting soaked. Please give me a hand!
    - languageType: 1
      speaker: "\uD50C\uB85C\uB77C"
      dialogue: "\uC2F9\uB4E4\uC774 \uB2E4 \uC816\uACA0\uC5B4. \uC870\uAE08\uB9CC
        \uB3C4\uC640\uC918!"
  - nextImage: 1
    translations:
    - languageType: 0
      speaker: Narrator
      dialogue: Mocha and Flora fitted a glass lid over the herb bed while Marin
        dug a drainage channel. Rain ran down the glass instead of onto the plants.
    - languageType: 1
      speaker: "\uB0B4\uB808\uC774\uC158"
      dialogue: "\uBAA8\uCE74\uC640 \uD50C\uB85C\uB77C\uAC00 \uC628\uC0C1\uC5D0 \uC720\uB9AC
        \uB36E\uAC1C\uB97C \uC5B9\uACE0, \uB9C8\uB9B0\uC774 \uB458\uB808\uC5D0 \uBB3C\uAE38\uC744
        \uB0C8\uB2E4. \uBE57\uBB3C\uC740 \uC57D\uCD08 \uB300\uC2E0 \uC720\uB9AC\uB97C
        \uD0C0\uACE0 \uD758\uB800\uB2E4."
  - nextImage: 0
    translations:
    - languageType: 0
      speaker: Flora
      dialogue: Now we just wait for the flowers.
    - languageType: 1
      speaker: "\uD50C\uB85C\uB77C"
      dialogue: "\uC774\uC81C \uAF43\uC774 \uD544 \uB54C\uAE4C\uC9C0 \uAE30\uB2E4\uB9AC\uBA74
        \uB3FC."
